+# Redoubt brand map for the Fenix / android-components string resources.
+# Owner: LW-M4-12.  Consumed by lw_brand_strings.py; see
+# docs/android/L10N-ANDROID.md in the LibreWolf repository for the mechanism
+# and the re-sync procedure.
+#
+# Line format:  <directive>|<field>|<field>...     '#' starts a comment.
+# The parser REFUSES any directive it does not know -- a silently ignored rule
+# is a rule that does not run.
+#
+#   brand|<name>              the name every brand token is replaced with
+#   derived-from|<commit>     android-l10n commit the word list was derived
+#                             from; must equal android-l10n-pin.txt's commit
+#   phrase|<from>|<to>|<note>  literal phrase replacement, run before words
+#   word|<stem>|<note>        a word containing <stem> (case-folded) has the
+#                             whole same-script run around the stem replaced
+#                             by the brand.  Replacing the same-script RUN and
+#                             not the whole word is deliberate: Korean and
+#                             Amharic glue particles straight onto the Latin
+#                             mark ("Firefox\ub97c", "\u12e8firefox"), so the
+#                             particle has to survive; Slavic inflections are
+#                             all-Latin, so "Mozilli" collapses to the brand
+#                             rather than to "LibreWolfli".
+#   url|<host>|<to>|<note>    host replacement, applied inside URL spans only
+#   url-keep|<host>|<why>     a host that carries the mark and MUST NOT change
+#   skip|<resource>|<why>     a resource this pass never touches
+#
+# Anything the substitution cannot clean is DROPPED from the translated file,
+# not shipped: see lw_brand_strings.rewrite_file.  Strings whose value equals
+# their own name (pref_key_*, mozac_error_*) are internal keys and are skipped
+# automatically -- rewriting them breaks stored preferences and error-page
+# image lookups.
+
+brand|Redoubt
+derived-from|b1b54243735917584168051b7206ca249427e86b
