+# the pinned android-l10n archive by `lw_brand_strings.py derive` and copied
+# from its output -- none of them was transcribed by a human, because a
+# mis-typed Malayalam or Sinhala stem fails silently.  Each was then checked
+# against that archive's whole corpus: a stem is only listed here if every
+# string in which it fires has an English source that mentions Firefox or
+# Mozilla.
+#
+# 32 non-Latin stems across 19 locales spell the mark in their own script.
+# An ASCII-only substitution -- which is what the desktop appstrings.properties
+# sed is -- sees none of them.
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+word|ಫೈರ್‌ಫಾಕ್ಸ್|kn
